spider-man no way home is set to throw  steven strange and peter parker into a  whole new adventure together but what's  the comic book background to these two  characters long-running friendship this  is the untold truth of spider-man and dr  strange's relationship  the first time spider-man and doctor  strange were shown working together on  the printed page was in 1965's amazing  spider-man annual number two this  marvelous team-up featured the  webslinger and the sorcerer supreme  pitting their wits and powers against a  sinister magic user named zandu who  sought to steal a powerful artifact from  the sanctum sanctorum after foiling the  villain's plans in an interdimensional  battle strange pledges his allegiance to  spider-man planting the seed that would  grow into a close friendship  chronologically however spider-man and  strange's first adventure together may  have been much earlier having been  depicted in 1998's untold tales of  spider-man strange encounters in this  flashback story strange enlists the wall  crawler's assistance in recovering the  mystical lantern of lantar which some  thugs stole from a museum due to an  earlier encounter with the lantern  wielding crooks spider-man senses have  become attuned to the ancient object's  location the trail leads to one of  strange's most dangerous foes baron  mordo who plans to offer human  sacrifices to his patron enigma in  exchange for ultimate power in the end  the two heroes defeat mordo strange  subsequently erases the memories of  mordo's captives at spider-man's request  even though it means they'll forget  spidey's heroics this selfless act makes  strange realize that there's more to  this young man than meets the eye  of all the tricks hidden up doctor  strange's billowy sleeves his hero  summoning tarot cards are perhaps the  most exciting when faced with incredible  threats that even he can't handle alone  strange uses his cards to assemble an  impromptu team known as the secret  defenders the roster changes depending  on who the cards reveal more often than  not the selected players are the heroes  who are best equipped to deal with the  menace at hand in issues number six to  number eight of secret defenders strange  enlists the aid of spider-man and the  scarlet witch to stop his persistent  foes zandu from enacting his latest plan  to merge earth with the death dimension  and rule them both the cards initially  pick ghostrider as the fourth member of  the roster but strange is unable to  contact him instead captain america  joins the team after accidentally  stumbling upon some magical chaos during  his nightly patrol with the aid of the  magical wand of wutoom zandu nearly  succeeds in his plot however thanks to a  last minute strategy that strange and  captain pull off zandia's former lover  melinda becomes the queen of the death  dimension feeling disgust over zandu's  actions she casts him out of the death  dimension permanently ending his brief  but tumultuous ring  spider-man is used to facing all kinds  of danger but even he acknowledges that  magical menaces are a little above his  pay grade well i i mean i'm i'd rather  just stay on the ground for a little  while friendly neighborhood spider-man  somebody's gotta look out for the little  guy right so whenever these mystical  threats pop up in his corner of the  world he's more than happy to receive  assistance from the sorcerer's supreme  one noteworthy example of this occurred  in the three-part story happy birthday  which ran from amazing spider-man vol 2  number 57 to amazing spider-man vol 1  number 500 after being soundly defeated  and scattered across various dimensions  by strange the evil being dormammu  tricks new york's heroes into helping  him reconstitute himself as swarms of  his mindless ones overrun manhattan a  mystical mishap knocks spider-man and  doctor strange outside of time and space  using a spell strange takes spider-man  through his whole past up to the exact  moment at which all hell broke loose  spider-man successfully prevents the  heroes from releasing dormammu with only  the sorcerer and the webslinger having  any recollection of what transpired as a  reward for his help strange hands  spiderman a tiny golden chest when he  opens it he receives the best surprise  of his life a few minutes with his uncle  ben who tells him just how proud he is  of the man peter has become  during marvel's civil war event  spider-man does the unthinkable in  support of the superhuman registration  act pioneered by tony stark he publicly  unmasks and tells the world that he is  peter parker unsurprisingly this  decision proves to be a huge mistake as  his aunt may is hit by a bullet courtesy  of one of the kingpin's assassins as the  life of his longtime mother figure hangs  in the balance peter seeks the aid of  doctor strange to save her unfortunately  strange admits he can do nothing to save  her life he helps peter reach out to the  marvel universe's other geniuses but  they all give him the same answer aunt  may is going to die so out of pure  desperation peter parker strikes a deal  with the demon mephisto to save his  dying aunt in return the demonic ruler  asks for peter's marriage with mary jane  watson which he deems as the rarest  purest love of all to hold up his end of  the bargain mephisto rewrites history so  that the marriage never happened in this  new reality doctor strange mr fantastic  and iron man merge science and magic to  make the world forget spider-man's  secret identity  in the concluding chapter of one moment  in time strange works with tony stark  and mr fantastic to infect the world  with a virus infused spell designed to  make everyone forget spider-man's secret  identity except for peter parker and  mary jane watson sound familiar entire  world is about to forget the peter  parker spider-man of course all of this  is rooted in peter's deal with mephisto  but no one not even peter himself  remembers that the demon is involved  regardless this ushers in a brand new  day for the webslinger a clean slate of  sorts that would remain largely intact  for over a decade in real time that is  until the events of amazing spider-man  vol 5 number 51 came to pass in order to  free his spider-powered allies from the  thrall of a literal villain from hell  called kindred spider-man consults  strange who attempts to cast a spell  with a mystical item to help him  surprisingly the spell fails prompting  strange to wonder if the wall crawler  has ever unknowingly struck any mystical  deals in the past strange's suspicions  lead him to the door of the hotel  inferno in las vegas mephisto's earthly  base of operations there he asks  mephisto point blank to tell him what's  wrong with peter parker's soul for a  while the infernal lord refuses to give  strange any straight answers even after  losing a wager with the source for a  supreme over the outcome of the  so-called sinister war their game  continues soon after however and strange  eventually manages to put a stop to  mephisto's plans and free spider-man  from the demon's control only then is it  revealed why mephisto targeted peter and  mj's relationship in the first place  because he fears the power of their  potential child  spider-man and doctor strange have  worked together on multiple occasions  showing off their best and worst  qualities to each other in the process  interestingly the good doctor has also  had the opportunity to collaborate with  two of the webslinger's most prominent  copycats both of whom were products of  science gone wrong in the 2017 limited  series damnation strange's longtime ally  wong assembles a temporary team of  supernatural heroes to save las vegas  from being overtaken by mephisto's  minions in the nick of time the team is  saved from certain doom by the scarlet  spider aka peter parker's clone ben  reilly together they are able to find  doctor strange and restore las vegas to  its normal state the sorcerer supreme  has also allied himself with another  superlative using superhero the superior  spider-man a reformed doctor octopus  occupying a perfect clone body of peter  parker in 2019 superior spider-man vol 2  number 5 the eye of agamotto reveals the  true identity of the san francisco-based  vigilante strange after strange calls  for spider-man's help initially  apprehensive to work with a notorious  criminal strange and the superior  spider-man set aside their differences  and save the day their shared adventure  ends with strange giving some  well-meaning advice to the arrogant hero  about honesty and accountability  during spider-man's brief but memorable  time in his symbiote costume peter  parker went on quite a few adventures  some which he barely remembers himself  one of these untold chapters of his life  was brought to light in the 2020 limited  series symbiote spider-man alien reality  which also revealed that at one point he  actually received training in the mystic  arts from dr strange himself waking up  to a bizarre world he barely recognizes  a symbiote-clad spider-man rushes to the  sanctum sanctorum hoping to get some  clarity from strange what he finds there  shocks him the hobgoblin his longtime  foe has become the apprentice of a  different sorcerer supreme and strange  himself is nowhere to be found  eventually the paths of the spider and  the true sorcerer supreme cross and  strange explains how the world was  transformed by a powerful book called  the word of god  together they concoct a plan to set the  world right again which includes  teaching spider-man a few defensive  spells to give him a fighting chance  against his newly mystic powered foe  strange and spider-man managed to defeat  hobgoblin and his master baron mordo  with some assistance from the  otherworldly being called nightmare  however spider-man retains no memory of  the events that transpired including the  spells he learned under strange  kid an avenger now  in his early years spider-man made a  number of attempts to join the avengers  each with varying levels of success  prior to 2005 the closest he had gotten  to becoming a card-carrying avenger was  becoming a reserve member in 1991's  avengers number 329 that changed however  when he joined the new avengers as a  full-time member alongside captain  america iron man spider woman luke cage  wolverine and the century not too long  after spider-man found himself joining  hands with his longtime magical ally  doctor strange new avengers number 27  features the debut of the latest  renegade avengers team as they rescue  their newest recruit echo from elektra  and the hand driven underground after  the events of the superhuman civil war  this team of new avengers operates from  strange's sanctum sanctorum while  evading arrest at the hands of the  government sanctioned team avengers led  by iron man  once upon a time whenever spider-man and  doctor strange teamed up it was almost a  given that their adventures would  involve some form of inter-dimensional  travel in modern times however  spider-man has found himself unassisted  by the sorcerer's supreme while crossing  the boundaries of the marvel multiverse  or to be more specific the spider-verse  while the concept of a room full of  spider-man teaming up was in 1994's  spider-man the animated series the first  time that comic books would adapt the  idea on a comparable scale was in the  2014 multi-part spider-verse crossover  the story features the main spider-man  peter parker on earth 616 reaching out  to various spider people across time in  space and enlisting their aid in a no  holds barred battle against the psychic  vampire morlan but hey with friends like  these who needs steven strange  the cooperative relationship between  spider-man and doctor strange would also  be reflected in the dystopian world of  2099 by their future counterparts in  fact the timely interference of one ends  up saving the other from pre-destined  death the spider-man of 2099 miguel  o'hara is a gifted but arrogant  geneticist who begins his heroic journey  after a sabotaged lab experiment grants  him spider powers meanwhile the  self-proclaimed sorceress supreme of  2099 is a young woman named jeannie who  trained herself in the mystic arts when  spider-man 2099 and strange 2099 first  meet in the pages of spider-man 2099  number 32 the sorceress asks for the aid  of the s-man in putting a stomp to a  zombie invasion in mexico city after  this adventure the two heroes would find  themselves teaming up from time to time  fighting against such foes as the  maestro the murderous future version of  the hulk however the most crucial piece  of assistance that spider-man 2099 ever  receives from the sorceress supreme  happens in the final issue of his  eponymous comic's third volume  sustaining near-fatal injuries in a  present-day battle against his mutated  hypnotized lover tempest miguel is saved  from certain death by a last minute  spell cast by strange 2099. by the time  spider-man 2099 wakes up his injuries  have been healed and he has been  transported to strange's headquarters in  the year 2100 it just goes to show no  matter where and when they might be  spider-man and doctor strange are  destined to be best of buds  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

